Package: SSPICE
Type: Package
Title: Systematic Skip-Pattern Integrity and Consistency Engine
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person( given = "Pierpaolo", family = "Massoli", role = c("aut", "cre"),
         email = "pimassol@istat.it" )
Description: Provides a graph-based framework for representing, analyzing, and
         validating structured statistical data governed by explicit logical
         dependencies, including questionnaire routing and other rule-based data
         structures. It supports the construction and structural analysis of directed
         acyclic graphs, preparation of record-level data, detection and localization
         of logical and skip-pattern inconsistencies, and generation of variable
         domains and formal compatibility rules. It also provides tools for
         evaluating empirical closure and minimality properties of the resulting Horn
         theory and for supporting the correction of inconsistent statistical
         records.
